  "description": "Maintain a list of numbers and return the product of the last k numbers. Use a prefix product array to achieve O(1) query time.",
  "target": null,
  "pseudocode": "1: function add(num) {\n2:   if (num === 0) prefix = [1];\n3:   else prefix.push(prefix[prefix.length - 1] * num);\n4: }\n5: function getProduct(k) {\n6:   if (k >= prefix.length) return 0;\n7:   return prefix[prefix.length - 1] / prefix[prefix.length - 1 - k];\n8: }",
